  <p id="c-nanshi-055-xiahou-dan-kui-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-055-xiahou-dan-kui-family:p001:m0000" ref="zz1_0tr_xni_A">亶</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-055-xiahou-dan-kui-family:p001:m0002" ref="zz1_0tr_xni_A">世龍</persName>，齊永元末，父<persName id="c-nanshi-055-xiahou-dan-kui-family:p001:m0011" ref="zz1_0tr_xni">詳</persName>爲西中郎南康王司馬，</p>
